<http://data.silknow.org/object/11938ca1-32fd-318f-ae3a-c82df8ef1aab>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Carpet made of silk velvet. In dark green, light blue, red and shades of gold on a ground of silk. The design of the field consists of six conventional plants and three trees. Border of scrolled flower stems. Cream ground, with 3 row pattern in green, red and blue, each row containing a central formal cypress tree flanked by a pair of fanciful flowering plants."@en , "Carpet made of silk velvet, India, probably late 17th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/2792ea09-45cd-3c6d-8549-a8242b049566> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/72e228cd-a753-304f-99d1-10c470c0fa1a> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/befda47c-f555-33db-8f72-201ce6174705> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/285d8c26-07b2-3925-bf84-c0f9b7f94ab5> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/a9555156-4035-3a2a-b505-b3f707df5f03> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/4b8d052a-2ce1-3880-9d08-e3f104bb10f0> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Carpet made of silk velvet. In dark green, light blue, red and shades of gold on a ground of silk. The design of the field consists of six conventional plants and three trees. Border of scrolled flower stems. Cream ground, with 3 row pattern in green, red and blue, each row containing a central formal cypress tree flanked by a pair of fanciful flowering plants."@en , "Carpet made of silk velvet, India, probably late 17th century"@en ;
